DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260215
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=14
SUMMARY:Trifon Zarezan — Day of Winegrowers and Winemakers
DESCRIPTION:Bulgaria's vine-pruning festival honouring St Tryphon\, patron 
 of winemakers. The Orthodox church moved the feast to 1 February in 1968\,
  but the country still keeps the growers' day on 14 February.\n\nRegion: B
 ulgaria\n\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trifon_Zarezan
CATEGORIES:tradition
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
